## SQ-MELT-08x | salt_dust click and salt dispensers against blue ice
> setblock 2048 -61 2076 minecraft:blue_ice
> zmelt w x08_click overworld 2048 -61 2076
> clear m3
> pbot hold m3 vintagedelight:salt_dust 3
> pbot use m3 2048 -61 2076 up
> pbot use m3 2048 -61 2076 up
> zp inv m3
waitlog \[zp\] done 20
> setblock 2052 -61 2076 minecraft:blue_ice
> zmelt w x08_disp_salt overworld 2052 -61 2076
> setblock 2052 -60 2076 minecraft:dispenser[facing=down]{Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"salt:salt",Count:3b}]}
> setblock 2052 -59 2076 minecraft:redstone_block
> setblock 2052 -59 2076 minecraft:air
> setblock 2052 -59 2076 minecraft:redstone_block
> data get block 2052 -60 2076 Items
