## P3-X1 | glowstone cage lantern: light per state (melting warning names it at light 3)
> setblock 2100 -60 2141 architects_palette:glowstone_cage_lantern[lit=true,facing=down]
> zmelt light overworld 2100 -60 2141
> zmelt light overworld 2101 -60 2141
> setblock 2100 -60 2141 architects_palette:glowstone_cage_lantern[lit=false,facing=down]
> zmelt light overworld 2101 -60 2141
look block light beside the lantern lit and unlit
